# Key Observation

Two strings are anagrams **iff**

1. They have the same length.
2. Every character appears the same number of times.

Example

```text
listen

↓

l = 1
i = 1
s = 1
t = 1
e = 1
n = 1
```

---

```text
silent

↓

s = 1
i = 1
l = 1
e = 1
n = 1
t = 1
```

Frequencies match.

Therefore

```text
True
```

