# Better Approach — Sorting

Sort both strings.

If they become identical, they are anagrams.

Example

```text
listen

↓

eilnst
```

---

```text
silent

↓

eilnst
```

Equal.

Therefore

```text
true
```

---

## Java Code

```java
import java.util.Arrays;

class Solution {

    public boolean isAnagram(String s, String t) {

        if (s.length() != t.length()) {
            return false;
        }

        char[] first = s.toCharArray();
        char[] second = t.toCharArray();

        Arrays.sort(first);
        Arrays.sort(second);

        return Arrays.equals(first, second);
    }
}
```

---

## Complexity

| Time | Space |
|------|-------|
| O(N log N) | O(N) |

Can still be improved.

