t = ""

Output

true
```

---

### Different Lengths

```text
abc

ab

↓

false
```

---

### Same Characters, Different Counts

```text
aab

abb

↓

false
```

---

### Unicode Example

```text
"åä"

"äå"
```

The `HashMap` solution works correctly.

The 26-element array solution does not.

